OL,3,GNEWSATV crime drama 'glamourises
OL,4,Adrugs', police chief says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA television crime drama set in
OL,7,FLiverpool "glamourises drugs" and shows
OL,8,Fcrime can be profitable, the region's
OL,9,Fchief constable has said.
OL,11,FMerseyside Police Chief Constable Rob
OL,12,FCarden said his officers regularly deal
OL,13,Fwith the kinds of criminal activity
OL,14,Fshown in the BBC One series This City
OL,15,FIs Ours.
OL,17,FHis comments come after a major police
OL,18,Foperation into serious and organised
OL,19,Fcrime on Thursday, involving over 220
OL,20,Fofficers, which saw 26 people arrested.
